                        "title": "Determine Initial and Final Velocities",
                        "content": "Calculate the velocities at the boundary limits $t = 2\\ s$ and $t = 3\\ s$:\n- At $t_1 = 2\\ s$: $v_1 = 2(2) + 1 = 5\\ m/s$\n- At $t_2 = 3\\ s$: $v_2 = 2(3) + 1 = 7\\ m/s$"
