                        "title": "Apply Equation of Continuity",
                        "content": "Let the velocities at section A and B be $v_A$ and $v_B$.\n$$A_A v_A = A_B v_B \\implies 6 \\times v_A = 3 \\times v_B \\implies v_B = 2v_A$$"
