                        "title": "Calculate Total Entropy Generation",
                        "content": "$\\dot{S}_{gen} = \\Delta\\dot{S}_g + \\Delta\\dot{S}_w = -0.892 + 1.111 = 0.219\\text{ kW/K}$."
