                        "title": "Define Stresses in terms of Diameter",
                        "content": "Bending stress $\\sigma = \\frac{32 M}{\\pi d^3}$. So $\\sigma_m = \\frac{32(400)}{\\pi d^3}$, $\\sigma_a = \\frac{32(200)}{\\pi d^3}$."
