            "question": "A rectangular concrete channel has a bottom width of $4\\text{ m}$ and carries a discharge of $20\\text{ m}^3\\text{/s}$. What is the critical depth of flow ($y_c$) in this channel? (Use $g = 9.81\\text{ m/s}^2$).",
