                        "title": "Determine Inverse Response Source",
                        "content": "When a numerator root is positive (an RHP zero, e.g., $1 - \\tau s$), the initial value theorem and time domain solution show that the process initially dips in the negative direction before the denominator dynamics pull it toward the positive steady state."
