                    {
                        "title": "Convert to Volume",
                        "content": "$1\\text{ mm}$ of depth over $1\\text{ m}^2$ equals $1\\text{ Liter}$. Therefore, $300\\text{ mm}$ corresponds to $300\\text{ L/m}^2$ annually."
                    }
