                        "title": "Change of Base Formula",
                        "content": "$X_{pu,new} = X_{pu,old} \\times \\frac{S_{base,new}}{S_{base,old}} \\times \\left(\\frac{V_{base,old}}{V_{base,new}}\\right)^2$"
